2f:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Vedanta provides a framework for understanding suffering, identity, and liberation. Practically, it cultivates dispassion (Vairagya), discrimination (Viveka), and equanimity — qualities that reduce reactivity and increase clarity."}]
